  <h2>Launch Your Brand in Weeks, Not Months</h2>
  <p>In the competitive world of activewear, speed to market is a critical advantage. Traditional manufacturing can take 60-90 days. Our <strong>ready-to-ship private label</strong> solution reduces this to as little as 2 weeks.</p>
  
  <h3>What is Ready-to-Ship Private Label?</h3>
  <p>We maintain a massive inventory of our most popular, high-performance styles. You select the products from our catalog, and we apply your custom branding, allowing you to bypass the long production lead times.</p>
  
  <h3>Key Benefits</h3>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Reduced Inventory Risk:</strong> Test new styles with low minimums before committing to large custom runs.</li>
    <li><strong>Fast Delivery:</strong> Products are already made; we just need to brand them.</li>
    <li><strong>Premium Quality:</strong> Our stock items meet the same rigorous BSCI and OEKO-TEX standards as our custom orders.</li>
  </ul>

  <p>Fitclo's ready-to-ship program is designed for brands that need to move fast without compromising on quality or identity.</p>
